        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart LR\n    %% Styling\n    classDef plain fill:#ffffff,stroke:#333333,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef etlStep fill:#f9f9f9,stroke:#6aa84f,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef dockerEnv fill:#f4f8ff,stroke:#0b5394,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5;\n\n    %% Orchestrator\n    Airflow((🌬️ Apache Airflow&lt;br/&gt;Orchestrator)):::plain\n\n    %% Docker Containerization wrapped around everything\n    subgraph Docker [🐳 Docker Environment]\n        direction LR\n\n        CSV[\\📁 Raw Data CSVs/]:::plain\n\n        subgraph Python [🐍 Python]\n            direction LR\n            E&gt;Extraction]:::etlStep --&gt; T&gt;Transform]:::etlStep --&gt; L&gt;Load]:::etlStep\n        end\n\n        subgraph SQLServer [🗄️ SQL Server]\n            direction TB\n            Dims[Dim_Listing&lt;br/&gt;Dim_Date&lt;br/&gt;Dim_Neighbourhood]:::plain\n            Facts[(Fact_Availability&lt;br/&gt;Fact_Reviews)]:::plain\n            Dims -.-&gt; Facts\n        end\n\n        %% Data Flow\n        CSV --&gt; E\n        L --&gt; Facts\n    end\n\n    %% Airflow Control Flow\n    Airflow ===&gt;|Triggers &amp; Schedules| Python&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="pnQHMpfk8OTU_ljVCBY_-1">
